<http://data.silknow.org/event/66c57664-9409-3572-baf5-0549a85c8cd6>
        a                              ecrm:E8_Acquisition ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Possibly commissioned for a member of the Jiustiniani and Rossi families of Venice.\nBought from Soulages for £40\n\nLent to GLORIA DELL’ARTE: a renaissance perspective, an exhibition at Philbrook, Art center, Tulsa, Oklahoma, October 28th, 1979- January 27th, 1980"@en ;
